# 🧭 RAG-Powered Talent Search Engine

**Ask in plain language, get explained candidates.** Resumes are embedded into a **vector database (FAISS / ChromaDB)**;
a hybrid semantic + keyword search retrieves the best matches; an **LLM (Llama 3 / GPT / Gemini)** explains *why* the top 3 fit -
grounded in the resume text, with personal data redacted - and a built-in **bias audit** checks the search for unfair behaviour.

[![CI](https://github.com/salikhussain71-code/rag-talent-search-engine/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/salikhussain71-code/rag-talent-search-engine/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.9%2B-blue)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green)

