> Dataset: Resume Entities for NER (Kaggle) · Tools: LangChain / LlamaIndex-style retrieval, ChromaDB / FAISS, Hugging Face Transformers, OpenAI / Gemini APIs
> Topics: RAG, vector databases, large language models

> **Recruiters don't want to read 1,000 resumes.** They want to ask: *"Find me a Junior Data Analyst who knows SQL and Tableau."*

